                String.valueOf(req.version()), req.supplierId(), req.materialCode(),
                String.valueOf(req.priority()), req.validFrom().toString(),
                req.validTo().toString()));
        parts.addAll(prefixes);
        String fingerprint = Fingerprints.of(parts);
