                "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z", "2027-01-01T00:00:00Z", 422);
        assertEquals("PREFIX_OVERLAP", objectMapper
                .readTree(rejected.getResponse().getContentAsString()).path("code").asText());
        // 不同优先级 → 允许
